  "historyNote": "#4235, eff 2-20-87, EXPIRED: 2-20-93 New. #5700, INTERIM, eff 9-17-93, EXPIRED: 1-15-94 New. #5824, eff 8-30-94, EXPIRED: 8-30-00 New. #7366, INTERIM, eff 9-18-00, EXPIRED: 3-17-01 New. #9143, eff 4-25-08",
